<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.931 pct.</title>
<headline>Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.931 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.931	 5.92-5.94   5.930</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 40)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.919	 5.91-5.92   5.910</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 86)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.974	 5.96-5.99   5.972</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 15)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
